21
01:33.969 --> 01:35.474
Tell the marketing team

22
01:35.474 --> 01:38.612
to ride this hashtag and run ads for our new project.

23
01:38.612 --> 01:39.569
Understood, Boss.

24
01:40.203 --> 01:41.788
Excuse me, darling.

25
01:41.788 --> 01:45.236
Could you stay still for just five seconds?

26
02:01.603 --> 02:02.503
You look so beautiful, sweetheart.

27
02:03.903 --> 02:05.103
Thank you, Mom.

28
02:05.803 --> 02:08.203
And you made such a smart choice in a groom.

29
02:08.769 --> 02:12.169
After the merger, the company's image feels much warmer.

30
02:12.403 --> 02:13.203
Of course.

31
02:15.636 --> 02:16.136
Hey.

32
02:16.688 --> 02:20.439
So you got married to make the company look warmer and friendlier?

33
02:20.439 --> 02:23.021
And why did it have to be Yong?

34
02:23.021 --> 02:26.719
He's ten years younger than you. Or are you planning to...

35
02:26.719 --> 02:29.636
Has Yong spoon-fed you when you're old?

36
02:32.203 --> 02:33.769
Is that seriously your mouth, Chom?

37
02:34.769 --> 02:36.836
