41
02:54.003 --> 02:55.537
From what I've heard,

42
02:55.888 --> 02:58.923
you should have no trouble handling major projects.

43
02:58.923 --> 03:02.307
Then, how about we turn on the cameras

44
03:02.307 --> 03:05.803
so we can get to know each other better?

45
03:13.069 --> 03:14.836
Why was it an old guy on the screen?

46
03:18.621 --> 03:19.503
Here, boss.

47
03:24.636 --> 03:27.635
Strength: Gets along with people easily.

48
03:28.237 --> 03:33.705
Weakness: Falls for other people's smiles a little too easily.

49
03:45.203 --> 03:46.003
Okay.

50
03:49.969 --> 03:51.216
Um, excuse me.

51
03:51.868 --> 03:52.503
This way, please.

52
03:58.903 --> 03:59.703
Useless.

53
04:00.769 --> 04:01.569
Useless.

54
04:06.303 --> 04:07.569
