55
04:15.669 --> 04:17.303
Ten years younger.

56
04:19.636 --> 04:20.836
Good image.

57
04:22.769 --> 04:24.069
Looks easy to control.

58
04:30.669 --> 04:31.769
Hello, Mom.

59
04:33.069 --> 04:34.969
You can start looking for a wedding date.

60
04:36.669 --> 04:37.469
Yes. Useless.

61
04:38.103 --> 04:40.036
I've found my future groom.

62
04:44.236 --> 04:45.036
Perfect.

63
04:53.069 --> 04:55.335
What's so great about Yong, anyway?

64
04:55.335 --> 04:59.385
All he ever posts are pictures with his family and parents.

65
04:59.636 --> 05:01.214
Going to temples and making merit.

66
05:01.615 --> 05:03.610
Always doing family activities.

67
05:03.610 --> 05:05.920
He's almost too well-behaved.

68
05:06.036 --> 05:06.836
Gosh!

69
05:07.503 --> 05:10.700
It's because Yong seems like a good person.

70
05:10.700 --> 05:12.729
He's obedient.

71
05:12.729 --> 05:15.669
Easy to control, unlike you, Chom.

72
05:16.069 --> 05:16.595
Hey!

73
05:17.046 --> 05:18.469
And most importantly,

74
05:19.969 --> 05:21.892
his family's cold storage business

75
05:21.892 --> 05:25.636
is a perfect match for our company.

76
05:27.003 --> 05:31.256
There! Finally telling the truth, Mrs. Theerachat.

77
05:31.808 --> 05:35.777
I already knew, so I went behind the scenes and talked to Yong's family.

78
05:36.780 --> 05:38.420
It's a win-win for both sides.

79
05:39.469 --> 05:41.236
That is so typical of Mrs. Chawee.

80
05:41.669 --> 05:42.636
Do you know, Mom?

81
05:43.203 --> 05:44.469
This wedding deal

82
05:45.203 --> 05:48.203
