86
05:57.471 --> 05:59.036
Look at the stock chart, Mom.

87
06:00.436 --> 06:03.169
Our stock has hit an all-time high.

88
06:04.069 --> 06:04.869
Impressive.

89
06:06.303 --> 06:07.769
I'll give you three seconds.

90
06:08.003 --> 06:08.803
Okay.

91
06:12.869 --> 06:14.803
I'll be done before three seconds are up.

92
06:16.969 --> 06:17.769
One.

93
06:19.403 --> 06:20.539
Two.

94
06:20.539 --> 06:21.662
Three.

95
06:22.063 --> 06:23.369
Perfect.

96
06:32.503 --> 06:33.303
Beautiful.

97
06:34.810 --> 06:35.584
Let's go.

98
06:36.236 --> 06:38.069
Let's go, Secretary Han.

99
06:38.803 --> 06:40.369
