105
07:00.069 --> 07:00.869
Huh?

106
08:21.670 --> 08:24.203
It's absolutely magnificent.

107
08:33.016 --> 08:34.303
Wow.

108
08:35.303 --> 08:36.803
Let's hear a round of applause.

109
08:37.337 --> 08:38.403
So beautiful. Absolutely gorgeous.

110
08:39.937 --> 08:41.137
Hello, everyone!

111
08:41.303 --> 08:44.737
Today, I'm Ja-Ja, and we're at a ten-billion-baht wedding.

112
08:45.037 --> 08:45.837
Ten billion!

113
08:46.303 --> 08:49.999
And here's our beautiful bride, Mrs. Chatworachotbadin.

114
08:49.999 --> 08:52.203
The gorgeous CEO of

115
08:52.603 --> 08:53.937
Honey Grain!

116
08:54.316 --> 08:55.737
Wow!

117
08:55.737 --> 08:58.870
But today, our viewers have a question for you, Mrs.Chat.

118
08:59.503 --> 09:01.002
Everyone wants to know...

119
09:01.002 --> 09:05.612
So what's really going on between Mr. Yong and Mrs. Chat?

120
09:05.612 --> 09:07.837
When did the sparks start flying? Could you tell us the story?

121
09:10.103 --> 09:14.103
Well, Mom sent me his résumé.

122
09:16.270 --> 09:17.070
His résumé?

123
09:17.737 --> 09:20.270
Oh, so your mom introduced you two?

124
09:20.670 --> 09:22.437
Ah, going through the parents.

125
09:22.437 --> 09:23.903
That's right.

126
09:24.437 --> 09:27.803
So what made you decide to get married, Mrs. Chat?

127
09:28.337 --> 09:30.837
Of course, it is because of the balance sheet.

128
09:34.337 --> 09:37.303
After the merger, profits should grow.

129
09:38.837 --> 09:40.103
