130
09:41.737 --> 09:44.501
The perfect match between the two of them.

131
09:44.501 --> 09:47.027
Okay, a perfect match.

132
09:47.027 --> 09:51.394
And the two families fit together perfectly, too.

133
09:51.394 --> 09:54.070
So where are you two going for your honeymoon?

134
09:54.270 --> 09:54.833
Yeah, where?

135
09:54.833 --> 09:56.702
Of course, we're going to...

136
09:56.702 --> 09:59.437
Dubai for a business trip.

137
10:00.803 --> 10:02.037
Huh? Business?

138
10:02.203 --> 10:03.202
Dubai!

139
10:03.202 --> 10:04.070
B-Business trip

140
10:04.203 --> 10:04.637
Dubai!

141
10:04.637 --> 10:07.237
You mean Dubai is a business hub, right?

142
10:07.537 --> 10:08.337
So you'll

143
10:08.437 --> 10:11.078
