144
10:11.078 --> 10:13.529
Wow, killing two birds with one stone!

145
10:14.133 --> 10:16.133
What a trip! How fabulous!

146
10:16.538 --> 10:17.635
So romantic!

147
10:17.635 --> 10:19.635
Absolutely fabulous.

148
10:19.636 --> 10:20.532
Could we get some solo shots of the bride?

149
10:20.532 --> 10:22.532
Let's make them beautiful!

150
10:23.023 --> 10:24.803
Boss Chat.

151
10:24.803 --> 10:28.048
The Singaporean investor we've been pursuing

152
10:28.048 --> 10:29.984
has confirmed their investment.

153
10:30.185 --> 10:32.237
They're also flying in next month for a site visit.

154
10:37.403 --> 10:38.476
See?

155
10:39.028 --> 10:40.757
This wedding brings nothing

156
10:41.158 --> 10:42.557
but profit.

157
10:43.945 --> 10:45.945
So smart

158
10:45.946 --> 10:47.093
Thirachat.

159
10:50.503 --> 10:52.081
Of course, we're going to...

160
10:52.081 --> 10:54.703
Dubai for a business trip.

161
10:55.137 --> 10:55.937
Dubai!

162
10:56.703 --> 10:58.137
She called me at midnight.

163
10:58.403 --> 10:59.503
She said she was getting married.

164
11:00.003 --> 11:01.437
So I asked her, "When?"

165
11:01.803 --> 11:03.110
She said, "Tomorrow morning."

166
11:03.110 --> 11:03.837
That crazy woman!

167
11:04.537 --> 11:05.670
I was so confused.

168
11:06.203 --> 11:07.003
Oh, God!

169
11:07.137 --> 11:07.703
Yeah.

170
11:07.703 --> 11:09.603
And she told me to get ready to be her bridesmaid, too.

171
11:09.803 --> 11:12.137
I'd just finished a C-section last night.

172
11:12.303 --> 11:13.203
How was I supposed to prepare?

173
11:14.137 --> 11:16.603
So this is what they call a whirlwind wedding.

174
11:22.470 --> 11:25.870
Ma, once the photos are done, can I go pick up my new car?

175
11:26.470 --> 11:27.582
Of course, sweetheart.

176
11:28.033 --> 11:31.237
As long as you do everything I tell you.

177
11:32.037 --> 11:32.837
Okay.

178
11:33.937 --> 11:35.210
Then let's head to the venue.

179
11:35.561 --> 11:37.103
There are tons of reporters waiting to interview us.

180
11:37.437 --> 11:39.403
Let's go, Pa and Ma

181
11:40.037 --> 11:44.337
Wait. You forgot the groom's boutonnière.

182
11:44.703 --> 11:48.203
Sorry, what boutonnière?

183
11:48.670 --> 11:49.737
The groom's boutonnière.

184
11:50.270 --> 11:51.870
Huh? The groom?

185
11:54.070 --> 11:56.178
Now, calm down, sweetheart.

186
11:56.780 --> 11:59.637
Mrs. Chat wants to marry you.

187
11:59.637 --> 12:02.137
And I thought it would be good for everyone.

188
12:03.237 --> 12:03.737
No!

189
12:03.737 --> 12:04.470
I won't do it!

190
12:05.537 --> 12:09.403
Yong, why are you raising your voice at Ma?

191
12:10.403 --> 12:13.203
Ma, I can't marry Mrs. Chat.

192
12:14.503 --> 12:15.611
If you refuse to marry her,

193
12:16.213 --> 12:18.017
you can forget about the new car!

194
12:18.017 --> 12:20.500
I'll freeze all your supplementary cards, too.

195
12:20.500 --> 12:22.470
Let's see how you'll manage after that!

196
12:23.337 --> 12:25.670
Ma, I'm not ready.

197
12:26.603 --> 12:27.437
(sighs)

198
12:28.070 --> 12:28.870
I know.

199
12:30.003 --> 12:33.937
But everything has already been arranged, Yong.

200
12:34.437 --> 12:37.337
Don't ruin the image we've worked so hard to build.

201
12:38.537 --> 12:39.903
Just go through with the wedding.

202
12:40.737 --> 12:42.237
Everything will work out afterward.

203
12:42.703 --> 12:44.603
Trust me, Yong.

204
12:47.337 --> 12:48.137
Come along.

205
12:57.737 --> 12:58.537
Nant.

206
12:59.203 --> 13:00.437
She is the only one who can help me now!

207
13:06.903 --> 13:07.703
Nant!

208
13:08.270 --> 13:09.103
Where are you?

209
13:11.037 --> 13:12.637
Come ruin my wedding right now.

210
13:13.670 --> 13:15.003
I’ll give you 100 grand.

211
13:22.070 --> 13:22.570
So beautiful.

212
13:22.570 --> 13:24.323
Absolutely gorgeous!

213
13:25.527 --> 13:27.106
Excuse me.

214
13:27.835 --> 13:29.835
The groom is here!

215
13:30.703 --> 13:32.403
Here comes our handsome groom.

216
13:33.003 --> 13:33.803
Wow.

217
13:33.903 --> 13:34.703
They're such a perfect match.

218
13:35.103 --> 13:36.070
The groom is so handsome.

219
13:36.337 --> 13:37.137
The bride is so beautiful.

220
13:37.303 --> 13:38.837
Let's get a photo of the happy couple.

221
13:39.503 --> 13:40.737
Look at the groom's face.

222
13:41.137 --> 13:42.670
He looks like such a delicate little rich boy.

223
13:43.070 --> 13:44.937
What the hell is Chat planning?

224
13:45.870 --> 13:46.670
Right.

225
13:49.137 --> 13:50.337
Hello, Young Master.

226
13:50.870 --> 13:52.037
It's a pleasure to meet you.

227
13:53.870 --> 13:55.037
The pleasure is mine.

228
14:07.137 --> 14:09.503
Are you looking for someone?

229
14:10.403 --> 14:11.537
N-No.

230
14:29.737 --> 14:30.755
Too rich for my blood.

231
14:32.059 --> 14:34.349
I’ve been hired to break up so many couples already.

232
14:35.252 --> 14:36.279
Who would've thought?

233
14:36.781 --> 14:38.863
Today, it's actually my best friend.

234
14:39.816 --> 14:42.372
Your best friend is here, Yong.

235
14:42.723 --> 14:43.503
Where are you going?

236
14:44.870 --> 14:47.670
Only VIP guests with invitations are allowed into this wedding.

237
14:55.837 --> 14:58.800
Oh, I'm not here for the wedding.

238
14:59.302 --> 15:02.319
Yong ordered something from me,

239
15:02.319 --> 15:04.503
