240
15:05.403 --> 15:06.138
What is it?

241
15:07.442 --> 15:09.470
You can leave it at the registration desk.

242
15:14.803 --> 15:17.850
I can't leave it there.

243
15:18.552 --> 15:20.837
It's a secret between Mr. Yong and me.

244
15:21.937 --> 15:23.313
Then please go home.

245
15:24.316 --> 15:25.203
This way, please.

246
15:30.303 --> 15:31.113
You!

247
15:32.066 --> 15:33.313
Do you know

248
15:34.166 --> 15:35.501
