249
15:36.354 --> 15:38.074
He's got to consummate the marriage.

250
15:39.529 --> 15:43.870
And what exactly is he supposed to do?

251
15:51.103 --> 15:53.576
Oh, come on!

252
15:54.228 --> 16:00.618
This is something to help him get it up.

253
16:01.320 --> 16:03.139
It's important.

254
16:05.403 --> 16:06.203
Err...

255
16:06.537 --> 16:08.603
As a fellow man, you'd understand, right?

256
16:09.670 --> 16:11.803
If he can't perform tonight,

257
16:12.403 --> 16:14.503
I'm as good as dead!

258
16:16.103 --> 16:16.903
Damn,

259
16:17.137 --> 16:18.403
What should I do?

260
16:18.937 --> 16:20.403
If he gets worked up...

261
16:20.903 --> 16:22.703
I won't get fired, will I?

262
16:25.417 --> 16:26.815
Damn!

263
16:27.249 --> 16:29.249
You're one of our people.

264
16:29.318 --> 16:32.020
I'm just going in to deliver something.

265
16:32.283 --> 16:33.631
That's all. Nothing more.

266
16:33.631 --> 16:35.611
You'll be doing the boss a good deed.

267
16:36.325 --> 16:37.071
Oh.

268
16:37.071 --> 16:38.118
You're one of our people, right?

269
16:38.524 --> 16:39.420
That's right.

270
16:40.255 --> 16:41.151
Here's the deal.

271
16:41.402 --> 16:42.499
Be quick about it.

272
16:42.779 --> 16:43.575
And most importantly...

273
16:43.575 --> 16:45.424
Don't get me into trouble, understand?

274
16:45.936 --> 16:46.933
If I get fired, I'm dead!

275
16:47.135 --> 16:48.282
Okay.

276
16:48.533 --> 16:50.717
Thanks a lot.

277
16:52.004 --> 16:53.137
I...

278
16:53.137 --> 16:54.590
wish you...

279
16:55.342 --> 16:59.005
