285
17:29.303 --> 17:31.403
It's actually a tear-inducing spray.

286
17:38.303 --> 17:39.685
Ow, ow!

287
17:41.441 --> 17:42.447
That stings.

288
17:42.447 --> 17:43.635
Ow.

289
17:44.137 --> 17:44.751
Ow.

290
17:45.905 --> 17:47.273
Ow.

291
17:51.070 --> 17:52.258
In five minutes,

292
17:52.258 --> 17:54.521
The ceremony will begin

293
17:54.772 --> 17:56.888
Please cooperate for just a little longer.

294
18:01.508 --> 18:02.404
You look gorgeous.

295
18:02.404 --> 18:03.652
You look perfect together. A match made in heaven.

296
18:05.737 --> 18:06.889
There are cameras everywhere.

297
18:07.240 --> 18:08.621
Give us a smile, please.

298
18:09.137 --> 18:09.983
Smile!

299
18:10.214 --> 18:11.411
Come on, smile!

300
18:14.359 --> 18:15.305
We've already interviewed the bride, right?

301
18:15.305 --> 18:15.805
Yes.

302
18:15.805 --> 18:18.252
Let's interview the groom now, shall we, Mr. Yong?

303
18:18.252 --> 18:18.847
Okay?

304
18:18.847 --> 18:22.101
So, Mr. Yong, how are you feeling right now?

305
18:22.402 --> 18:22.947
Oh...

306
18:23.361 --> 18:25.361
Well, today, I wasn't going to get marr

