318
18:57.603 --> 18:59.238
Oh, no, it's just...

319
18:59.238 --> 19:00.794
The truth is, I just...

320
19:00.794 --> 19:01.294
I just...

321
19:01.637 --> 19:02.137
Just...

322
19:02.137 --> 19:02.637
Yes?

323
19:03.670 --> 19:05.703
About to launch a new project!

324
19:06.070 --> 19:06.903
Whoa!

325
19:08.537 --> 19:11.829
