That's right.

328
19:15.552 --> 19:17.103
It's definitely a big project.

329
19:18.037 --> 19:19.133
A massive one.

330
19:19.133 --> 19:20.703
Bigger than anyone expects.

331
19:21.303 --> 19:23.703
But for now, we'll have to keep it a secret.

332
19:24.203 --> 19:25.774
We're saving it as a surprise.

333
19:25.774 --> 19:26.274
Ooh!

334
19:26.470 --> 19:27.437
A secret.

335
19:27.870 --> 19:28.270
A secret.

336
19:28.270 --> 19:30.437
It's top secret until the big reveal.

337
19:31.070 --> 19:31.870
Or could it be...

338
19:39.079 --> 19:40.528
Honey!

339
19:40.528 --> 19:41.976
Whoa!

340
19:44.262 --> 19:45.610
Wait a minute.

341
19:49.529 --> 19:51.529
Hey! Hey!

342
19:53.503 --> 19:55.470
Yong is going to have a baby!

343
19:55.471 --> 19:57.270
What?!

344
19:57.472 --> 19:57.972
A baby?

345
19:57.972 --> 19:59.037
Whose baby?

346
19:59.803 --> 20:00.603
Holy shit!

347
20:06.237 --> 20:07.903
This is Yong's baby!

348
20:08.103 --> 20:09.070
And as for Yong...

349
20:09.737 --> 20:12.603
Yong is my husband!

350
20:21.949 --> 20:23.337
What the hell is going on?

351
20:25.303 --> 20:26.403
Looks like you're in trouble now, girl.

352
20:28.937 --> 20:30.270
You're not getting out of this alive.

353
20:32.870 --> 20:33.803
Yong.

354
20:35.070 --> 20:35.870
Honey!

355
20:36.537 --> 20:38.603
You're abandoning your heavily pregnant wife...

356
20:39.537 --> 20:42.237
To marry this old lady instead?

357
20:45.803 --> 20:47.303
Yong, look at me.

358
20:48.003 --> 20:48.803
I'm...

359
20:48.803 --> 20:49.703
I'm still young.

360
20:49.837 --> 20:50.903
I'm still beautiful.

361
20:54.552 --> 20:55.870
Hey!

362
20:55.870 --> 20:58.203
But this old lady is beautiful, too.

363
20:59.137 --> 20:59.937
It's just...

364
21:01.003 --> 21:02.837
She's beautiful in a more mature way.

365
21:08.903 --> 21:09.703
That’s brutal.

366
21:11.203 --> 21:13.103
Mrs. Chat, aren't you going to say anything?

367
21:14.137 --> 21:16.807
Everyone, take a good look at this!

368
21:16.807 --> 21:19.093
This woman stole my husband!

369
21:19.093 --> 21:21.070
She stole my baby’s daddy!

370
21:23.899 --> 21:25.899
Mrs. Chat, what the hell is going on?

371
21:26.284 --> 21:27.632
Wait!

372
21:29.103 --> 21:30.337
Who stole your husband?

373
21:32.003 --> 21:34.303
And stop calling me an old lady!

374
21:38.537 --> 21:39.788
Ouch!

375
21:40.537 --> 21:41.337
My stomach hurts!

376
21:41.837 --> 21:42.837
When you talk to me like that...

377
21:43.203 --> 21:44.470
You stress me out.

378
21:44.837 --> 21:45.903
Whoa!

379
21:46.637 --> 21:49.003
I feel so sorry for little Tiger!

380
21:49.637 --> 21:51.340
Whoa!

381
21:51.637 --> 21:52.437
Help me!

382
21:52.503 --> 21:53.303
Little Tiger!

383
21:53.303 --> 21:54.103
Yong!

384
21:54.437 --> 21:56.503
Yong, please help your wife and baby!

385
21:56.941 --> 21:58.941
Stop!

386
22:06.637 --> 22:07.577
Boss.

387
22:07.928 --> 22:08.738
Now,

388
22:09.340 --> 22:11.516
The Singaporean investors...

389
22:11.516 --> 22:13.337
They've decided to put their investment on hold.

390
22:15.737 --> 22:20.129
So she really is his lawful wife, and that's really his child?

391
22:21.020 --> 22:21.847
But that's not what's happening!

392
22:21.847 --> 22:22.493
Exactly.

393
22:24.260 --> 22:25.262
What's going on?

394
22:25.262 --> 22:26.115
She announced it in the middle of the wedding!

395
22:26.115 --> 22:28.115
Ruining the wedding is one thing...

396
22:30.037 --> 22:32.106
But ruining a hundred-million deal?

397
22:32.107 --> 22:34.107
That's too much!

398
22:36.161 --> 22:36.907
Whoa!

399
22:39.034 --> 22:39.930
Chom!

400
22:40.833 --> 22:41.981
Take care of the guests.

401
22:41.981 --> 22:43.168
Okay.

402
22:43.722 --> 22:45.722
What's gonna happen next? We're live right now.

403
22:48.335 --> 22:49.252
End the live!

404
22:49.837 --> 22:52.070
But we have millions of viewers.

405
22:52.137 --> 22:54.337
The comments are going absolutely wild.

406
22:54.470 --> 22:55.270
If you don't stop it...

407
22:56.103 --> 22:58.229
Should I have a court order

408
22:58.229 --> 23:00.003
delivered to your office tomorrow to shut it down?

409
23:00.237 --> 23:01.747
We'll end it now. Close the camera.

410
23:01.747 --> 23:02.951
Do it now! Everyone stop!

411
23:02.951 --> 23:03.451
It's done! We stopped the live.

412
23:03.537 --> 23:04.437
Secretary Han!

413
23:06.003 --> 23:07.003
Get the media out.

414
23:07.137 --> 23:07.937
Yes, Boss.

415
23:08.003 --> 23:09.070
I'll take care of it.

416
23:09.303 --> 23:10.237
Everyone, please...

417
23:10.670 --> 23:11.670
This way, please.

418
23:12.037 --> 23:12.837
Please come with me.

419
23:12.870 --> 23:14.103
No interviews for now.

420
23:14.337 --> 23:15.403
Boss isn't available.

421
23:15.503 --> 23:16.303
This way, please.

422
23:16.670 --> 23:17.470
Please come along.

423
23:17.503 --> 23:18.437
Right this way.

424
23:37.637 --> 23:38.937
Why didn't you run away?

425
23:40.270 --> 23:42.403
I felt sorry for the security guard.

426
23:44.137 --> 23:45.470
Worry about yourself first!

427
23:54.503 --> 23:56.003
Are you two done whispering?

428
24:05.803 --> 24:09.737
Yong, do you still love me and our baby?

429
24:10.237 --> 24:11.037
I love you.

430
24:15.103 --> 24:15.903
Love me?

431
24:16.470 --> 24:18.937
If you love me, why are you marrying this old lady?

432
24:21.003 --> 24:22.537
Ma forced me!

433
24:22.837 --> 24:24.637
I told her I didn't want an arranged marriage!

434
24:24.870 --> 24:26.937
I don't care about this merger or any of it!

435
24:28.503 --> 24:30.055
Oh, I see...

436
24:31.837 --> 24:33.803
So your mom and this old lady forced you?

437
24:35.603 --> 24:38.137
Wait a minute. Who forced whom?

438
24:42.670 --> 24:43.239
Yong!

439
24:44.292 --> 24:46.337
Both our families agreed to this!

440
24:47.037 --> 24:48.603
I didn't even know about it, Ma.

441
24:49.203 --> 24:50.003
Jeez.

442
24:50.470 --> 24:51.475
We'll deal with the adults' business later.

443
24:51.977 --> 24:53.772
Right now, you have some explanation to give.

444
24:53.772 --> 24:55.602
Who is this girl?

445
24:55.853 --> 24:56.905
Is she your wife?

446
25:00.537 --> 25:01.337
Yes!

447
25:03.237 --> 25:06.003
I'm his wife! I was his wife before this old lady!

448
25:17.037 --> 25:18.550
I can't take this anymore!

449
25:18.901 --> 25:20.054
I'm counting on you.

450
25:20.665 --> 25:21.511
Yong!

451
25:21.511 --> 25:22.658
Yong, come back here!

452
25:22.658 --> 25:23.655
Yong!

453
25:24.389 --> 25:25.486
Wait, Yong.

454
25:25.486 --> 25:26.537
Yong.

455
25:26.966 --> 25:28.314
He just left me here.

456
25:28.848 --> 25:30.296
What do I do now?

457
25:30.598 --> 25:31.645
Yong, you bastard.

458
25:32.179 --> 25:33.376
He really ran away?

459
25:34.437 --> 25:35.670
He just abandoned me.

460
25:36.470 --> 25:37.270
What am I supposed to do now?

461
25:38.037 --> 25:38.837
What do I do?

462
25:43.203 --> 25:45.737
My hundred-million-baht deal is ruined because of you!

463
25:59.103 --> 26:06.303
I didn't mean to make things this big.

464
26:07.837 --> 26:09.322
Erm...

465
26:11.337 --> 26:15.871
I've decided to give up.

466
26:17.075 --> 26:17.744
I will...

467
26:19.048 --> 26:21.541
I'll get out of your way.

468
26:21.541 --> 26:24.871
Bye.

469
26:26.777 --> 26:28.087
It's too late for that.

470
26:35.470 --> 26:36.470
Secretary Han.

471
26:36.903 --> 26:38.303
Go bring Yong back.

472
26:38.837 --> 26:39.837
Understood, Boss.

473
26:46.703 --> 26:48.335
You caused all this trouble...

474
26:49.188 --> 26:51.237
And now you think you can just walk away?

475
26:51.537 --> 26:53.760
Oh, no! I'm not running away.

476
26:54.512 --> 26:57.759
I didn't mean to run away.

477
26:58.210 --> 27:01.102
As I said...

478
27:01.102 --> 27:03.193
I've already given up.

479
27:03.444 --> 27:04.605
I...

480
27:05.870 --> 27:09.191
I'll let you have Yong.

481
27:09.191 --> 27:12.791
You can have him! I'm done.

482
27:18.208 --> 27:19.260
You'll let me have him?

483
27:19.511 --> 27:20.638
Now?

484
27:21.140 --> 27:22.289
After you made such a scene...

485
27:22.590 --> 27:24.653
And completely ruined my wedding?!

486
27:26.203 --> 27:30.790
Oh, right. That's true.

487
27:31.392 --> 27:33.272
I'm so sorry.

488
27:34.537 --> 27:36.270
I accept apologies in cash.

489
27:37.703 --> 27:39.463
Oh, speaking of money...

490
27:40.717 --> 27:42.218
I don't have any.

491
27:42.920 --> 27:44.137
I really don't have any money.

492
27:47.437 --> 27:48.015
No money?

493
27:49.470 --> 27:50.640
No money?

494
27:50.640 --> 27:53.333
No money at all?

495
27:54.286 --> 27:56.281
You had the nerve to act so bold without any money to your name.

496
27:58.538 --> 27:59.066
Fine.

497
28:00.420 --> 28:03.202
Then get ready to receive a court summons!

498
28:11.703 --> 28:13.362
Ow! That hurts!

499
28:13.813 --> 28:14.592
Let me go!

500
28:14.592 --> 28:15.092
Let me go!

501
28:15.092 --> 28:15.837
I'm not letting go!

502
28:23.537 --> 28:25.870
Hello? What did you say?

503
28:30.403 --> 28:34.103
Tell the media to stop reporting this immediately!

504
28:36.537 --> 28:39.562
Ow!

505
28:39.562 --> 28:42.394
Ouch, my stomach!

506
28:42.394 --> 28:44.419
The baby is coming!

507
28:44.419 --> 28:46.295
My water just broke!

508
28:46.295 --> 28:47.611
My stomach hurts!

509
28:48.965 --> 28:50.738
Calm down! Take it easy!

510
28:53.237 --> 28:56.365
Hello, Secretary Han? Call an ambulance!

511
28:56.365 --> 28:58.445
This girl is going into labor!

512
28:58.947 --> 29:00.809
Come sit down first.

513
29:00.809 --> 29:01.520
Easy...

514
29:01.520 --> 29:02.414
Easy...

515
29:05.023 --> 29:09.471
Easy, Secretary Han, call an ambulance!

516
29:11.860 --> 29:13.603
My stomach hurts!

517
29:13.603 --> 29:14.740
What do we do? Stay calm!

518
29:17.700 --> 29:18.444
Stay calm. It's okay.

519
29:18.444 --> 29:19.748
Easy, easy.

520
29:20.450 --> 29:22.400
(Chat) Take a breath first. (Nant) My stomach hurts!

521
29:22.400 --> 29:23.919
Breathe. Breathe.

522
29:27.171 --> 29:29.171
Breath.

523
29:29.903 --> 29:30.681
That's it.

524
29:31.183 --> 29:35.597
Breathe in.

525
29:35.598 --> 29:39.454
Breathe out.

526
29:39.454 --> 29:43.310
Like a flower blooming.

527
29:43.544 --> 29:46.748
Like a vast mountain range.

528
29:47.050 --> 30:00.186
Like cool, flowing water.

529
30:03.870 --> 30:05.203
My voice is still as perfect as ever.

530
30:30.870 --> 30:32.137
Go bring her back.

531
30:33.137 --> 30:33.937
Right now!

532
30:34.870 --> 30:35.603
Go!

533
30:35.603 --> 30:37.237
Understood, Boss.

534
30:49.470 --> 30:50.337
Chat...

535
30:50.837 --> 30:53.470
I had no idea things would turn out like this.

536
30:53.937 --> 30:55.537
I'll hold a press conference myself.

537
30:56.003 --> 30:58.103
I'll make sure your reputation isn't damaged.

538
31:00.437 --> 31:01.237
Enough.

539
31:02.937 --> 31:04.137
My reputation...

540
31:05.903 --> 31:09.837
Was ruined the moment that girl called me an old lady...

541
31:10.837 --> 31:12.470
In front of everyone at the wedding.

542
31:16.470 --> 31:17.737
As for the press conference...

543
31:18.903 --> 31:21.437
Please do whatever you want, Auntie Lin.

544
31:22.603 --> 31:24.237
But about the merger deal.

545
31:25.237 --> 31:26.403
I'm canceling it.

546
31:26.937 --> 31:29.503
And I'm withdrawing all my investments.

547
31:30.870 --> 31:32.237
Wait, Chat!

548
31:33.803 --> 31:35.270
Mom, Chom, please go get some rest.

549
31:36.237 --> 31:37.270
I want to be alone.

550
31:38.503 --> 31:41.003
How can I leave you here alone, Chat?

551
31:41.337 --> 31:42.603
I'm worried about you.

552
31:44.103 --> 31:45.139
But right now...

553
31:45.540 --> 31:46.914
The person we should be more worried about...

554
31:47.616 --> 31:48.937
Is Auntie Lin, Chom.

555
31:49.303 --> 31:50.862
Ma'am! Ma'am!

556
31:50.862 --> 31:54.534
Please calm down. Take it easy.

557
31:54.534 --> 31:55.034
Calm down.

558
31:55.034 --> 31:55.534
Breathe.

559
31:55.534 --> 31:56.395
Breathe.

560
31:56.395 --> 31:57.403
Chom.

561
31:57.403 --> 31:58.028
Yes?

562
31:58.028 --> 31:59.514
Go get Hanna for me.

563
31:59.765 --> 32:00.466
And...

564
32:01.003 --> 32:02.537
Should I go get Hanna first...

565
32:02.703 --> 32:04.603
Or call an ambulance first?

566
32:04.903 --> 32:05.870
Call the ambulance first, dear.

567
32:06.470 --> 32:07.403
Okay!

568
32:07.537 --> 32:08.070
Hurry, dear!

569
32:08.070 --> 32:08.870
Please wait a moment.

570
32:10.503 --> 32:11.270
Stay calm. It's okay.

571
32:11.270 --> 32:11.819
Breathe.

572
32:11.819 --> 32:12.437
Hello?

573
32:48.970 --> 32:50.000
[Pure drama mid-wedding! #CEOHusbandSnatcher]

574
32:50.245 --> 32:56.093
[People on X is losing their mind over what happened at that wedding!]

575
33:06.537 --> 33:07.837
Give me the full damage report.

576
33:08.837 --> 33:09.337
Okay.

577
33:10.942 --> 33:13.821
The Singaporean investors have canceled their investment, Boss.

578
33:14.724 --> 33:18.742
Some board members are preparing to vote you out as CEO.

579
33:19.545 --> 33:23.670
They say your public image is affecting investor confidence.

580
33:29.903 --> 33:31.003
What about X trends?

581
33:32.403 --> 33:32.918
The hashtag...

582
33:33.721 --> 33:36.637
#CEOHusbandSnatcher is trending at number one.

583
33:47.270 --> 33:48.237
Secretary Han.

584
33:49.437 --> 33:51.203
Investigate that girl's background.

585
33:51.637 --> 33:54.003
If she's chosen to destroy my reputation...

586
33:55.137 --> 33:57.037
She will pay for it to the fullest extent.

587
33:57.703 --> 33:58.737
Understood, Boss.

588
34:00.137 --> 34:00.937
Okay.

589
34:03.070 --> 34:04.070
I want it by tomorrow.

590
34:04.737 --> 34:05.537
Understood, Boss.

591
34:19.137 --> 34:20.903
All those keyboard warriors...

592
34:23.537 --> 34:24.803
Even with her face blurred...

593
34:26.437 --> 34:28.237
I'll never forget her face.

594
34:44.070 --> 34:44.870
Nant.

595
34:46.837 --> 34:48.437
Hong, you bastard.

596
34:48.637 --> 34:49.637
You just abandoned me!

597
34:50.137 --> 34:50.937
I'm sorry.

598
34:51.270 --> 34:53.203
If I'd stayed any longer, we'd both be dead!

599
34:53.437 --> 34:54.670
That woman is terrifying.

600
34:58.937 --> 35:00.937
Here, I'll transfer you the money.

601
35:07.237 --> 35:08.031
And look at you!

602
35:08.633 --> 35:10.089
If you're going to pretend to be my wife...

603
35:10.390 --> 35:12.553
Couldn't you dress a little more high-end?

604
35:13.870 --> 35:15.137
You know that's all I can afford.

605
35:15.470 --> 35:18.618
Fine, fine. Use the money to pay off your debts.

606
35:18.618 --> 35:20.470
And keep your head down for a while.

607
35:20.903 --> 35:22.137
Yeah, I know!

608
35:23.203 --> 35:24.837
Thanks so much, my dear friend.

609
35:26.470 --> 35:28.113
Come here. Give me a kiss.

610
35:28.113 --> 35:28.737
Eww!

611
35:29.503 --> 35:30.303
Gross!

612
35:30.437 --> 35:32.637
I've had enough horror for one day.

613
35:34.937 --> 35:36.737
Now, I'll go face the consequences with Ma.

614
35:37.437 --> 35:38.144
Bye.

615
35:48.603 --> 35:49.403
See you.

616
36:37.203 --> 36:39.048
Tuition fees... Rent...

617
36:39.349 --> 36:41.499
Paying off debts...

618
36:41.750 --> 36:43.903
And I'll still have enough left for shabu.

619
36:55.437 --> 36:56.837
Have you forgotten about me, sweetheart?

620
36:59.703 --> 37:00.503
Hello.

621
37:02.070 --> 37:05.203
I... I was planning to pay you today.

622
37:07.270 --> 37:09.203
But could I just pay the interest for now?

623
37:09.537 --> 37:10.337
Just the interest?

624
37:10.703 --> 37:12.029
Hey!

625
37:13.932 --> 37:14.666
Hey!

626
37:14.961 --> 37:15.619
Let me see!

627
37:15.619 --> 37:16.670
Give it back!

628
37:16.803 --> 37:17.870
Hey, no need to rush.

629
37:20.803 --> 37:21.603
Damn!

630
37:23.637 --> 37:24.437
She has got 100 grand...

631
37:24.903 --> 37:26.877
Yet you lied and said you'd only pay the interest?!

632
37:26.877 --> 37:27.703
Huh?

633
37:28.137 --> 37:29.537
I really need that money!

634
37:30.037 --> 37:30.648
Give it back!

635
37:30.648 --> 37:31.303
Hey!

636
37:33.344 --> 37:36.197
I really need that money.

637
37:36.789 --> 37:38.187
Please give it back.

638
37:38.771 --> 37:39.667
Hand it over!

639
37:40.151 --> 37:41.298
Please, give it back!

640
37:42.585 --> 37:43.130
Come here.

641
37:43.130 --> 37:43.876
Get up!

642
37:44.166 --> 37:44.962
Get up!

643
37:50.270 --> 37:51.070
Face the camera!

644
37:52.437 --> 37:53.237
Hey!

645
37:53.337 --> 37:54.003
Face the camera!

646
37:54.003 --> 37:56.403
Pay up nicely, or do I need to mess up that pretty face of yours?

647
37:57.070 --> 37:57.870
Look at the camera.

648
38:02.903 --> 38:03.837
That's more like it.

649
38:16.070 --> 38:17.838
Consider your debt fully paid.

650
38:19.042 --> 38:22.071
Come back to me when you're broke again, girl.

651
38:42.437 --> 38:44.303
Crying won't get your money back.

652
38:57.637 --> 38:59.337
Guess Shabu will have to wait.

653
40:21.603 --> 40:22.670
It's just fake news...

654
40:23.837 --> 40:25.403
But people are ready to believe it.

655
40:31.703 --> 40:32.503
Hanna!

656
40:32.603 --> 40:34.737
Is our PR team completely useless or what?

657
40:35.303 --> 40:37.103
How did they let this get so out of hand?

658
40:37.403 --> 40:39.870
The team is coordinating with all the news outlets right now.

659
40:40.037 --> 40:41.903
The clips have been posted by so many accounts.

660
40:42.137 --> 40:46.047
And people love this kind of drama, so the reposts keep skyrocketing, Boss.

661
40:48.303 --> 40:50.103
Should I just fire the whole team?

662
40:50.537 --> 40:51.470
Please don't, Boss.

663
40:52.237 --> 40:53.203
What about the original video?

664
40:53.803 --> 40:55.037
Have you found out who posted it?

665
40:55.470 --> 40:58.247
Not yet. It seems to have been spread across multiple accounts.

666
40:58.247 --> 41:00.337
Tracing it back to the original source is proving very difficult.

667
41:00.670 --> 41:01.912
Then start with the people sharing it.

668
41:01.912 --> 41:04.123
Anyone who shares edited images...

669
41:04.123 --> 41:07.337
Or spreads false information, take screenshots for all the evidence.

670
41:07.637 --> 41:11.103
Understood. And what about tomorrow's press conference?

671
41:12.303 --> 41:14.003
Let the Yong family handle it.

672
41:14.803 --> 41:16.203
I'm not saying anything for now.

673
41:16.937 --> 41:19.603
The more I say, the more I'll play into the hands of whoever started this.

674
41:23.470 --> 41:24.637
What about that girl?

675
41:25.803 --> 41:27.303
Have you found out who she is?

676
41:28.070 --> 41:29.470
We're still investigating.

677
41:33.670 --> 41:36.903
I need her information by seven tomorrow morning, Secretary.

678
41:37.954 --> 41:39.954
Understood, Boss Chat.

679
41:46.070 --> 41:49.937
In just one day, everything I've built nearly fell apart.

680
41:52.403 --> 41:54.470
Who is she?

681
42:01.503 --> 42:03.013
Send notices to every page that posted the clip.

682
42:03.013 --> 42:05.403
If they don't take it down, send them court summonses.

683
42:10.737 --> 42:11.537
Hello?

684
42:13.003 --> 42:13.803
What?

685
42:14.603 --> 42:16.470
You couldn't identify the taxi from its license plate?

686
42:17.337 --> 42:19.437
Here's what we'll do. Check every surveillance camera.

687
42:20.137 --> 42:21.203
Do it now.

688
42:27.403 --> 42:29.670
Boss Chat needs that woman's information by seven tomorrow morning.

689
42:29.870 --> 42:31.470
Otherwise, the whole team is getting fired.

690
42:35.103 --> 42:36.603
Ugh, three percent battery!

691
42:42.003 --> 42:44.303
Is this a charging cable or my lifeline?

692
42:44.603 --> 42:46.103
Why is everything such a mess?

693
42:58.470 --> 43:02.103
A hundred thousand gone in three minutes.

694
43:10.503 --> 43:12.537
But a debt is a debt. I have to pay it back, right?

695
43:14.803 --> 43:15.603
Damn it.

696
43:16.237 --> 43:17.337
I just paid it off a little too quickly.

697
43:42.137 --> 43:42.937
Whatever.

698
43:43.637 --> 43:44.737
Back to work!

699
43:45.670 --> 43:47.503
At least one debt is gone.

700
43:49.203 --> 43:50.803
I'll find a way to pay the tuition.

701
43:52.337 --> 43:53.870
And the rent, too.

702
43:56.037 --> 43:57.670
I'll find a way to pay for the land.

703
43:58.603 --> 44:01.303
I'll take fifty more fake-breakup gigs.

704
44:02.103 --> 44:03.470
And stay single for another ten years.

705
44:04.337 --> 44:05.141
Eventually, these damn debts will...

706
44:05.843 --> 44:07.152
Just disappear somehow.

707
44:12.137 --> 44:12.937
Just keep fighting!

708
45:24.270 --> 45:25.070
Hello?

709
45:26.337 --> 45:27.137
Mm-hmm.

710
45:28.537 --> 45:29.470
Uh, Ai...

711
45:30.337 --> 45:31.503
Is Jaokha there with you?

712
45:31.903 --> 45:33.703
Yeah, I'm about to call her over.

713
45:34.503 --> 45:36.070
Where are we meeting?

714
45:37.037 --> 45:38.003
Rush Bar.

715
45:38.437 --> 45:39.237
Huh?

716
45:40.037 --> 45:40.903
A new place?

717
45:42.237 --> 45:43.037
Sigh...

718
45:43.203 --> 45:45.670
I don't feel like going somewhere crowded today.

719
45:46.403 --> 45:48.703
Don't worry. This place is super private.

720
45:48.870 --> 45:50.403
Only customers with reservations can get in.

721
45:50.703 --> 45:52.270
No one will see you, I promise.

722
45:53.337 --> 45:54.137
Okay.

723
45:55.070 --> 45:56.637
Then send me the location.

724
45:58.003 --> 45:58.837
Yeah, yeah.

725
45:59.803 --> 46:00.603
See you there.

726
46:17.703 --> 46:18.837
Hello, Mom.

727
46:20.637 --> 46:22.137
Where are you all dressed up to go?

728
46:25.037 --> 46:26.603
I'm going out for a drink.

729
46:27.470 --> 46:31.270
The news just broke today. What if someone sees you, Mrs. Chat?

730
46:32.870 --> 46:35.272
Mom, I just got dumped at the altar.

731
46:35.272 --> 46:37.884
I'm not a fugitive running from the law.

732
46:37.884 --> 46:40.472
I just want to go out and be happy for two or three hours.

733
46:40.472 --> 46:41.737
Can't I?

734
46:46.237 --> 46:48.437
I promise I won't cause any more headlines.

735
46:49.703 --> 46:51.837
Hmm. Don't come home too late, sweetheart.

736
46:52.870 --> 46:53.670
Okay, Mom.

737
47:49.603 --> 47:50.403
Nant...

738
47:51.537 --> 47:52.337
Is...

739
47:52.937 --> 47:54.103
Is that really you?

740
47:54.937 --> 47:55.437
Huh?

741
47:55.437 --> 47:55.937
Look.

742
47:56.003 --> 47:56.803
What?

743
47:57.270 --> 48:00.103
You're in the CEOHusbandSnatcher clip, right?

744
48:07.270 --> 48:08.737
You're famous now!

745
48:11.003 --> 48:12.070
Famous for what?

746
48:12.903 --> 48:14.337
For something like this?

747
48:14.503 --> 48:15.303
No thanks.

748
48:17.237 --> 48:18.137
Yeah, fair enough.

749
48:19.637 --> 48:23.615
But you're this famous now, and you're still coming to work?

750
48:23.615 --> 48:24.670
Aren't you scared?

751
48:27.137 --> 48:30.737
Of course I am. But I'm more scared of having no money.

752
48:34.803 --> 48:36.503
What if you run into her again?

753
48:38.470 --> 48:41.203
I'll run! Why would I stick around and let them catch me?

754
48:42.337 --> 48:44.870
But surely my life can't get that unlucky, right?

755
48:45.937 --> 48:46.837
Whatever you say.

756
48:48.103 --> 48:50.503
I'll go serve VIP Table One first.

757
48:50.703 --> 48:53.103
Okay, go ahead. I'll be serving tables soon, too.

758
49:40.003 --> 49:42.903
Hey, where's that petite girl who was here earlier?

759
49:43.303 --> 49:44.637
Oh, we let her go.

760
49:44.637 --> 49:47.092
She was clumsy and stepped on a guest's foot.

761
49:47.092 --> 49:49.403
The guest got hurt, so we had to let her go.

762
49:50.337 --> 49:54.070
As I've told you before, at Rush Bar, the customer is king.

763
49:55.437 --> 49:56.888
See? I told you.

764
49:56.888 --> 49:58.724
You can relax here.

765
49:59.376 --> 50:01.654
Why don't we move to the seats in front of the stage?

766
50:01.955 --> 50:03.034
The view is amazing!

767
50:03.034 --> 50:03.603
Let's go.

768
50:04.337 --> 50:05.137
I'm not going.

769
50:06.870 --> 50:09.903
This spot is fine. I don't want to run into anyone.

770
50:11.003 --> 50:13.355
Come on. Let's check out some girls.

771
50:13.756 --> 50:15.904
You'll forget all the chaos from today.

772
50:17.537 --> 50:20.103
The only thing that'll make me forget today...

773
50:21.237 --> 50:23.203
Is pure alcohol.

774
50:28.237 --> 50:29.103
Why the rush to chug it down?

775
50:31.337 --> 50:32.303
Wait for us.

776
50:32.503 --> 50:33.503
Another drink, please.

777
50:34.403 --> 50:35.203
Coming right up.

778
50:38.003 --> 50:38.803
Love me?

779
50:39.337 --> 50:41.703
If you love me, why are you marrying this old lady?

780
50:42.303 --> 50:43.470
Hey, look at this.

781
50:43.670 --> 50:44.237
What?

782
50:44.237 --> 50:47.270
Did you see Hi-So Theerachat's face when that girl called her an old lady?

783
50:48.070 --> 50:49.873
She looked so damn humiliated.

784
50:50.939 --> 50:54.946
Gosh, these perfectionists are honestly so trash!

785
50:57.063 --> 50:59.063
Such an old lady...

786
51:04.837 --> 51:08.537
Talking too much. Should I shove a liquor bottle down her throat?

787
51:08.937 --> 51:11.874
Calm down. You're already all over the news.

788
51:12.526 --> 51:13.787
Should we go confront them?

789
51:14.903 --> 51:18.503
No need. I want to hear what else they have to say.

790
51:24.437 --> 51:26.837
Here are your drinks, ladies.

791
51:31.070 --> 51:31.870
No way.

792
51:33.403 --> 51:34.303
Honey!

793
51:35.837 --> 51:38.032
Would you like

794
51:38.433 --> 51:40.703
any snacks or mixers with your drinks?

795
51:42.470 --> 51:43.837
I don't want any mixers.

796
51:44.337 --> 51:45.137
What I want...

797
51:49.070 --> 51:52.103
Is for you to sit and drink with us.

798
52:04.680 --> 52:06.680
Cheers!

799
52:08.703 --> 52:09.503
Keep them coming, darling.

800
52:09.749 --> 52:10.896
Another round.

801
52:16.703 --> 52:18.067
Cheers!

802
52:26.037 --> 52:27.883
Whoa!

803
52:36.537 --> 52:38.365
Cheers!

804
52:49.503 --> 52:51.637
Smooth and sweet!

805
52:56.003 --> 52:56.803
Oh.

806
52:57.037 --> 53:00.803
What a shame. I'd love to keep drinking with you...

807
53:02.603 --> 53:03.537
But that's okay.

808
53:04.803 --> 53:07.470
I'll just take this tip, then.

809
53:13.537 --> 53:15.406
Thank you for the money.

810
53:16.537 --> 53:18.668
Bye.

811
53:20.437 --> 53:21.237
Hey! What the hell?

812
53:21.337 --> 53:22.137
The pregnant girl.

813
53:22.337 --> 53:23.137
Thief!

814
53:23.237 --> 53:23.937
Hey!

815
53:23.937 --> 53:24.737
Wait, what?

816
53:25.137 --> 53:25.937
We've got her.

817
53:27.103 --> 53:27.903
Old lady!

818
53:33.037 --> 53:35.627
What? I didn't steal anything.

819
53:35.627 --> 53:38.456
This is the tip the customer gave me.

820
53:38.757 --> 53:40.138
A tip?

821
53:41.337 --> 53:43.846
Looks to me like you're stealing money from a drunk customer.

822
53:43.847 --> 53:45.847
No No No No

823
53:45.847 --> 53:47.295
These are my tips.

824
53:47.296 --> 53:48.845
I'm not stealing.

825
53:49.783 --> 53:50.730
Um

826
53:50.731 --> 53:52.731
If you don't have anything more.

827
53:53.014 --> 53:55.014
I'll go.

828
53:55.507 --> 53:56.537
You're not going anywhere!

829
53:57.188 --> 53:59.188
You're not getting away this time.

830
54:00.637 --> 54:01.437
Well, well...

831
54:02.037 --> 54:03.237
Fancy meeting you again so soon.

832
54:03.803 --> 54:05.003
Who is it, Chat?

833
54:07.737 --> 54:08.603
Look closely.

834
54:11.070 --> 54:11.870
Doesn't she look familiar?

835
54:13.737 --> 54:14.537
Hmm. Don't come home too late, sweetheart.

836
54:15.137 --> 54:16.537
Jao Kha, does she look familiar to you?

837
54:17.070 --> 54:17.870
This girl...

838
54:20.003 --> 54:23.070
Isn't she the pregnant woman who ruined your wedding?

839
54:23.071 --> 54:24.620
No No No No

840
54:25.436 --> 54:27.737
We have never met each other before, yeah

841
54:28.043 --> 54:30.043
I don't recognize your face.

842
54:30.416 --> 54:32.416
That is my sister

843
54:32.797 --> 54:35.650
She's my twin. She's pregnant!

844
54:36.364 --> 54:37.662
Your twin?

845
54:39.883 --> 54:41.131
Yeah!

846
54:42.861 --> 54:44.109
Real...

847
54:44.861 --> 54:46.088
Real twins.

848
54:47.891 --> 54:52.677
Identical twins who just happen to have a mole above their left eye...

849
54:52.677 --> 54:53.950
In exactly the same spot.

850
54:54.025 --> 54:56.025
Oh really.

851
54:56.538 --> 54:58.538
Um... Becuase...

852
54:59.278 --> 55:00.275
Um

853
55:00.600 --> 55:03.403
The egg is big at the same time, you know...

854
55:03.404 --> 55:05.404
Pure science, yeah!

855
55:06.203 --> 55:08.537
I'm an obstetrician, and I've never heard that theory before.

856
55:08.953 --> 55:10.953
Wow, I feel sorry for you.

857
55:17.070 --> 55:20.560
And your twin just happens to have the same scratch on her wrist...

858
55:20.961 --> 55:23.538
And the same necklace, too?

859
55:23.903 --> 55:25.637
I thought so.

860
55:25.837 --> 55:27.473
Thought so. Thought so.

861
55:28.639 --> 55:31.893
The necklace? I bought it during a buy-one-get-one-free sale, yeah!

862
55:32.203 --> 55:33.637
And the scratch...

863
55:35.203 --> 55:36.703
It's from my kitty cat.

864
55:37.203 --> 55:38.337
Meow, you know

865
55:39.270 --> 55:40.303
It's not me, okay?

866
55:40.937 --> 55:42.337
I need to go.

867
55:42.737 --> 55:44.637
I need to go. Bye-bye!

868
55:51.803 --> 55:53.351
And I suppose your twin...

869
55:53.351 --> 55:56.303
Also passed her baby-powder scent on to you, huh?

870
56:20.642 --> 56:21.765
Scared?

871
56:22.252 --> 56:23.862
Remember this feeling.

872
56:23.862 --> 56:26.593
Because from now on, you'll pay me back

873
56:26.796 --> 56:28.309
until I'm satisfied.

874
56:30.603 --> 56:32.603
About the money. I don't have it.

875
56:32.604 --> 56:35.237
But I have something you want even more than money.

876
56:35.892 --> 56:37.064
What exactly do you want?

877
56:37.064 --> 56:38.188
You have to hire me.

878
56:38.188 --> 56:41.013
As your personal secretary intern. For three months,

879
56:41.573 --> 56:43.573
At double the salary.
